<main id="main" class="page narrow"><h1>Privacy & community information</h1><section class="panel prose"><h2>Your account</h2><p>Fan Hub Plus stores your display name, email, password hash and the profile information you choose to provide. It also stores your bookmarks, private notes, ratings, submissions, feedback and assistant history. Administrators can manage accounts and review submissions and feedback.</p><h2>Sessions and display preferences</h2><p>A session cookie keeps you signed in. Display preferences can be kept in this browser and saved to your account. Sign out when using a shared device.</p><h2>Event location and external media</h2><p>Nearby event sorting asks for your permission before reading browser location. Your coordinates stay in the browser. Maps and external media are provided by third-party services and may receive your IP address when loaded.</p><h2>Community submissions</h2><p>Share only content you created or have permission to use. Approved submissions are published with their content and images. Do not submit confidential information. Use Feedback to request a correction or ask an administrator to remove your account.</p><h2>Merchandise</h2><p>Items are displayed for discovery only. This platform has no shopping cart, checkout, payments or order processing.</p></section><a href="<?=e(base_url('User/feedback.php'))?>">Contact through feedback</a></main><?php require __DIR__.'/includes/footer.php';?>
